  "records": [
    {
      "record_id": "R1",
      "position": 1,
      "raw": {
        "text": "目标上诉前的案情叙述记载：原房东于1961年10月1日将争议房屋出租给上诉人；被上诉人系原房东之女，于1964年6月27日向父亲购买该房产，并继承其房东地位。",
        "statement_status": "UNKNOWN",
        "refs": [
          "IK-1114159:L238:restored-v2"
        ]
      },
      "interface_valid": true,
      "case_refs": [
        "IK-1114159:L238:restored-v2"
      ],
      "source_roles": {
        "IK-1114159:L238:restored-v2": "CASE_RECORD"
      },
      "case_use_available": true,
      "semantic_verified": false
    },
    {
      "record_id": "R2",
      "position": 2,
      "raw": {
        "text": "在先法定机关的认定援引了Rent Note、上诉人于1961年10月7日及1962年8月18日致原房东的信件，以及此前有关商业性转租的驱逐程序。所给材料没有载明这些文件的具体内容。",
        "statement_status": "RECORDED_DOCUMENT",
        "refs": [
          "IK-1114159:L239:restored-v2"
        ]
      },
      "interface_valid": true,
      "case_refs": [
        "IK-1114159:L239:restored-v2"
      ],
      "source_roles": {
        "IK-1114159:L239:restored-v2": "CASE_RECORD"
      },
      "case_use_available": true,
      "semantic_verified": false
    },
    {
      "record_id": "R3",
      "position": 3,
      "raw": {
        "text": "两个在先法定机关认定房屋原本为住宅目的出租，但又被附带用于商业目的，并据此认为第14(1)(e)条结合其Explanation不适用。",
        "statement_status": "PRIOR_COURT_FINDING",
        "refs": [
          "IK-1114159:L239:restored-v2"
        ]
      },
      "interface_valid": true,
      "case_refs": [
        "IK-1114159:L239:restored-v2"
      ],
      "source_roles": {
        "IK-1114159:L239:restored-v2": "CASE_RECORD"
      },
      "case_use_available": true,
      "semantic_verified": false
    },
    {
      "record_id": "R4",
      "position": 4,
      "raw": {
        "text": "德里高等法院在先审理时认为，没有证据足以支持法定机关关于该房屋曾用于商业目的的结论。",
        "statement_status": "PRIOR_COURT_FINDING",
        "refs": [
          "IK-1114159:L240:span3"
        ]
      },
      "interface_valid": true,
      "case_refs": [
        "IK-1114159:L240:span3"
      ],
      "source_roles": {
        "IK-1114159:L240:span3": "CASE_RECORD"
      },
      "case_use_available": true,
      "semantic_verified": false
    },
    {
      "record_id": "R5",
      "position": 5,
      "raw": {
        "text": "在先法院认定材料记载，没有提交可证明争议房屋曾被用于接待外国学生住宿及膳宿的书面证据；该表述限于书面证据的缺失。",
        "statement_status": "PRIOR_COURT_FINDING",
        "refs": [
          "IK-1114159:L241:span4"
        ]
      },
      "interface_valid": true,
      "case_refs": [
        "IK-1114159:L241:span4"
      ],
      "source_roles": {
        "IK-1114159:L241:span4": "CASE_RECORD"
      },
      "case_use_available": true,
      "semantic_verified": false
    },
    {
      "record_id": "R6",
      "position": 6,
      "raw": {
        "text": "租客在此前转租争议中主张，她从未交出房屋任何部分的独占占有；住宿的外国学生只是付费客人，而非她的承租人。",
        "statement_status": "PARTY_CLAIM",
        "refs": [
          "IK-1114159:L244:restored-v2"
        ]
      },
      "interface_valid": true,
      "case_refs": [
        "IK-1114159:L244:restored-v2"
      ],
      "source_roles": {
        "IK-1114159:L244:restored-v2": "CASE_RECORD"
      },
      "case_use_available": true,
      "semantic_verified": false
    },
    {
      "record_id": "R7",
      "position": 7,
      "raw": {
        "text": "房东在此前有关转租的程序中提出存在分租关系的主张；该主张与租客关于付费客人及独占占有的陈述相对立。",
        "statement_status": "PARTY_CLAIM",
        "refs": [
          "IK-1114159:L244:restored-v2"
        ]
      },
      "interface_valid": true,
      "case_refs": [
        "IK-1114159:L244:restored-v2"
      ],
      "source_roles": {
        "IK-1114159:L244:restored-v2": "CASE_RECORD"
      },
      "case_use_available": true,
      "semantic_verified": false
    },
    {
      "record_id": "R8",
      "position": 8,
      "raw": {
        "text": "此前转租争议中的认定否定了房东提出的分租主张，理由是有关住宿者属于付费客人，而非分租承租人。",
        "statement_status": "PRIOR_COURT_FINDING",
        "refs": [
          "IK-1114159:L244:restored-v2"
        ]
      },
      "interface_valid": true,
      "case_refs": [
